>> Also, does anyone have any general tips for playing by this conduct?

> For instance, is it a good plan to use the starting !oFHs to up your
> HP, since you're going to be stuck at level 1 for a while?

Why should you be stuck to level 1 for a while? There's never a good
reason to stay on a level after you've cleared it from monsters and items.
This goes for pacifists as well.

When the level has been cleared, continue on! Your pet needs fresh
monsters to kill or it won't grow, and it needs to grow as soon as
possible. For your character, the level of the monsters encountered
doesn't matter, since it will be avoiding them anyway.

The only reason to be careful while descending is that you don't want to
meet too many at the same time, since your pet can only handle them
one-by-one and has to heal in between.

Having said that, level 1 is a good level to retreat to once in a while to
heal yourself by resting.

